### Temu 管理后台接口测试

@temuAccessToken = uplv3hfyt5kcwoymrgnajnbl1ow5qxlz4sqhev6hl3xosz5dejrtyl2jre7
@temuAuthCode = replace-with-temu-auth-code

### 查询 Temu access_token 权限信息
POST {{baseUrl}}/temu/auth/access-token-info
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{
  "site": "US",
  "accessToken": "{{temuAccessToken}}"
}

### 使用 Temu 授权码创建 access_token
POST {{baseUrl}}/temu/auth/access-token/create
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{
  "site": "US",
  "accessToken": "{{temuAccessToken}}",
  "code": "{{temuAuthCode}}"
}

### 查询 Temu 本地店铺标签
POST {{baseUrl}}/temu/auth/local-mall-tags
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{
  "site": "US",
  "accessToken": "{{temuAccessToken}}"
}
